# <APP>-CONSTITUTION-001 — <Application> product constitution

## Purpose and authority

State what durable product rules this document governs and who may approve changes.

## Product principles and invariants

For each principle, state whether it is owner-approved or inferred and link its source decision or requirement.

## Decision rights

Name the accountable product owner, delegated reviewers, and decisions agents must return for owner resolution.

## Cross-cutting commitments

Record applicable security, privacy, accessibility, reliability, data integrity, localization, and operational commitments. Link to detailed requirements; do not restate their full implementation plan here.

## Change control

Describe how changes are proposed, reviewed, versioned, and linked to affected artifacts.

